<mxfile host="render_drawio.py">
  <diagram id="use-case" name="Enter the Tithe">
    <mxGraphModel grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="BOUNDED-CONTEXT" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 8;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-160" y="-360" width="1400" height="720" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="BOUNDED-CONTEXT-HEADER" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#666666;fillColor=#D9D9D9;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontSize=25;fontColor=#333333;opacity=50;" value="Bounded Context: Tithe" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-160" y="-400" width="1400" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="BOUNDED-CONTEXT-DESCRIPTION" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;The Tithe itself: one run into the Maw for up to 8 candidates – players and NPC rivals – from the start room to the Champion. It lays out the depths from the Tithe's seed, holds the candidates and the monsters, resolves the blows, moves the candidates down the stairs, keeps their life and hunger, and ends a player's part of the Tithe when the gate is passed, someone else claims it, or the player falls or leaves. It also holds the help." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-150" y="-360" width="400" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="USE-CASE" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 8;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-120" y="-200" width="1320" height="520" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="USE-CASE-HEADER" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#666666;fillColor=#D9D9D9;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontSize=25;fontColor=#333333;opacity=50;" value="Use Case: Enter the Tithe" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-120" y="-240" width="1320" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="DESCRIPTION" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;For the players: when the player who opened a Tithe launches it, it is laid out anew and up to 8 candidates – players and NPC rivals – descend into it, each in a room of their own, so every run is a new race to the bottom." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-110" y="-200" width="400" height="140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject id="EVT-01" label="Tithe launched&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;(Online Play / Lobby)" tooltip="Launch the Tithe">
          <mxCell parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#FFB366;strokeColor=#994C00;dashed=1;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="120" height="120" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="EVT-01-HEADER" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#FF8000;strokeColor=#994C00;dashed=1;" value="Event" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="0" y="-20" width="120" height="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject id="SVC-01" label="Tithe master" tooltip="Starts a Tithe when the matchmaker has filled it.">
          <mxCell parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#D689D6;strokeColor=#660066;" vertex="1">
